<title>USA: Cal-Maine to buy Southern Empire Egg Farm.</title>
<headline>Cal-Maine to buy Southern Empire Egg Farm.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cal-Maine Foods Inc said it reached an agreement to buy all the assets of Southern Empire Egg Farm of Shady Dale, Georgia, for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Southern Empire, with 1996 revenues of about $20 million, has about 1.3 million laying hens, said Cal-Maine.</p>
<p>Its customers include major chain stores and institutional accounts in Georgia, South Carolina and other surrounding states, according to Cal-Maine.</p>
</text>
